In my real hook, I was running additional side effects (state updates) before calling the transition. Those updates triggered a re-render, and calling startTransition after that was causing isPending to stay false.

Moving everything inside the transition fixed it.

```typescript
// ❌ DOES NOT WORK: isPending stays false
const refresh = () => {
  // Side effect triggers re-render before transition
  onSuccess?.(); 

  startTransition(() => {
