Seeing `/_next/static/chunks/pages/index.js.map` in the error stack, this looks related to Node 22's changed module loading behavior.

Since Node 22, `require(esm)` works differently, and the reason it only crashes on the first request is probably module caching. Once loaded and cached, the second request onwards won't hit the same code path.

